     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div>My group at the Air Quality Research Center is looking for someone with R and data analysis/visualization experience to help us. The job was just posted to the general UCD employment page (<a href=\"https://www.employment.ucdavis.edu/applicants/jsp/shared/position/JobDetails_css.jsp?postingId=342845\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.employment.ucdavis.edu/applicants/jsp/shared/position/JobDetails_css.jsp?postingId%3D342845&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466896397000&amp;usg=AOvVaw10xYlj4bhPIjBy4sMxLsMH\">Scientific Programmer</a>), but I thought this group might be interested or might be able to give me a hot tip on a good candidate. Does anyone have any ideas where this might have interest? My thought is that the ideal person would be a recent grad student who fell in love with programming.</div><div>We are heavily invested in using Shiny to develop analysis and QC tools.  I&#39;ll paste some screenshots of some of our tools below; I think they&#39;re pretty cool. Let me know if there is interest in sharing how they were built. I&#39;d be happy to set up a demo and share our experiences. Unfortunately, I can&#39;t send you a working link as they are only available on our local network.</div><div>Cheers, and sorry if this is too far off topic,</div><div>Sean Raffuse</div><div><br></div><div>Data Group Manager</div><div>Air Quality Research Center</div><div>UC Davis</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-QYzicjWxsOg/WSS6q2HlU0I/AAAAAAAAAAM/uXAcslHm3w4JqGpaeTJdCtktuNNOrPk4gCLcB/s1600/2017-05-23%2B15_33_30-CSN%2BData.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-QYzicjWxsOg/WSS6q2HlU0I/AAAAAAAAAAM/uXAcslHm3w4JqGpaeTJdCtktuNNOrPk4gCLcB/s1600/2017-05-23%252B15_3